! Material definition order is intentionally different from construction
! occurrence order and from material-name order. EIO rows must follow the
! construction/layer traversal, not this object-definition sequence.
WindowMaterial:Gap:EquivalentLayer,
  Z XENON SEALED EQL GAP,
  Xenon,
  0.0155,
  Sealed;

! This valid definition is deliberately unused by every equivalent-layer
! construction. Its absence from EIO locks occurrence rather than definition
! emission semantics.
WindowMaterial:Gap:EquivalentLayer,
  DISTINCTIVE UNUSED AIR SEALED EQL GAP,
  Air,
  0.0166,
  Sealed;

